.undo/

# Local extension state. Which extensions you enabled and which you trusted is a
# per-machine decision: a committed copy is deliberately ignored at load time
# (see docs/EXTENSIONS.md), so a cloned repo can never grant itself execution
# permission. Keeping these out of git avoids the confusing half-state where the
# file is tracked but has no effect.
extensions/enabled.json
extensions/trust.json
